{"_note":"`xJob/daily-brief.xjob` 的判定段:按锚点日去重(`asc.db.last`),首跑只建基线不响(§7)。 生成器 gen_asc.py。","version":1,"actions":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"okIn","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${bok},0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"adIn","value":"${ad}"}},{"id":"prevRaw","action":"data.get","params":{"key":"asc.db.last","default":""}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"prev","value":"${prevRaw}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hasPrev","value":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${prev},__none__),__none__),0,1)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hit","value":"$[if::(eq::(${okIn},1),if::(eq::(${hasPrev},1),if::(eq::(${adIn},${prev}),0,1),0),0)]"},"_note":"⚠️ 日期串比较:两边都是 yyyy-MM-dd,eq 数字化不了就逐字比(不能换成 yyyyMMdd 纯数字 —— 那样会按数值比)。"},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(${okIn},1),1,0)]"},"items":[{"action":"data.set","params":{"key":"asc.db.last","value":"${adIn}"}}],"_note":"只在拿到答案时写基线:缺编号 / 没权限的那几轮不写,否则权限补上之后第一天会被当成「已报过」。"},{"action":"resultFilter","params":{"keys":["hit"]}}]}
